# NOTE: do not reintroduce a blanket `.*` rule here.
# It silently excluded .github/, so CI was never committed and never ran —
# the fmt, clippy, test, OpenSSL and MSRV gates all existed only locally.
# List dotfiles individually instead.

# Acceptance evidence: real addresses and message contents. Attach a sealed
# run to a release deliberately; do not commit it by accident.
evidence/
